          "label": "145B模型卡",
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/Edge0/Edge0-145B-q3k",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-code-21323",
      "title": "Claude Code 2.1.323 加入实验性 Code Mode，并修正权限边界",
      "titleId": "claude-code-21323-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "新增让 Claude 编写 JavaScript 调用工具的实验性 Code Mode，同时修复沙箱可能在会话中关闭、部分包装命令漏过 deny/ask 规则等问题。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "依赖编码代理运行本地工具的用户应回归自己的权限规则。新版还改变了未知模型的默认上下文估计；第三方小窗口模型需要检查相关配置，不能把新模式当作额外安全隔离。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-12",
      "dateLabel": "11月12日 · 已发布；Code Mode 需主动启用",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-12",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-12T22:12:13Z",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "官方 v2.1.323 发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.323",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uv-0138-variants",
      "title": "uv 0.13.8 改进硬件变体选择与并发环境复用",
      "titleId": "uv-0138-variants-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "新版避免多个 uvx 或 uv run --with 同时请求相同环境时重复构建，并把 Unix 明文凭据文件限制为仅所有者访问。预览功能扩展到 CPU 微架构、AArch64 版本及 Google TPU 检测。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "本地 AI 的 Python 环境可减少重复准备，并评估更匹配硬件的 wheel；硬件变体选择仍属预览，不代表所有包都有优化构建。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-12",
      "dateLabel": "11月12日 · 已发布；wheel variants 仍为预览",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-12",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-12T17:03:07Z",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "uv 官方发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/tag/0.13.8",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nodejs-nov-security",
      "title": "Node.js 修补 HTTP/2、TLS 与权限模型问题",
      "titleId": "nodejs-nov-security-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Node.js 22.23.5、24.22.3、26.13.1已发布，修复16项漏洞，涉及HTTP/2崩溃、内存泄漏、TLS认证边界、代理凭据进入错误日志及文件权限模型。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "运行Node后端、本地AI网关或工具服务时，应更新对应维护分支并回归连接中断、文件响应和mTLS。各漏洞的触发条件不同，不能概括为所有Node应用都能被远程接管。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-11",
      "dateLabel": "11月11日 · 已发布 · 近7日补充",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-11",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-11",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Node.js官方安全公告",
          "url": "https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/november-2026-security-releases",
          "icon": false
        },
        {
          "label": "官方公告完整源码",
          "url": "https://github.com/nodejs/nodejs.org/blob/main/apps/site/pages/en/blog/vulnerability/november-2026-security-releases.md",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ubuntu-glibc-security",
      "title": "Ubuntu 更新 glibc，修补加载器与 DNS 安全边界",
      "titleId": "ubuntu-glibc-security-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "USN-9065-1覆盖Ubuntu 22.04、24.04、26.04 LTS和26.10，修复文件编码处理、DNS、动态加载器及gettext路径问题，部分条件下可导致代码执行或本地提权。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "本地推理主机应更新系统运行库，而非只升级Python或npm依赖。24.04的修补版libc6为2.39-0ubuntu8.12，22.04为2.35-0ubuntu3.18；公告未声称在野利用。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-12",
      "dateLabel": "11月12日 · 安全更新",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-12",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-12",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Ubuntu官方公告",
          "url": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-9065-1",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mcp-gateway-registry-security",
      "title": "MCP Gateway Registry 升级后仍需清理旧授权和地址",
      "titleId": "mcp-gateway-registry-security-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "AWS披露MCP Gateway Registry提权和SSRF问题。前者影响1.0.9–1.24.7，早在6月27日的1.25.0修复；后者影响1.0.3–1.34.0，需要至少1.35.0。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "集中管理AI工具的用户应审查已有分组授权、上游服务器地址与日志：升级不会撤销旧管理员映射或修正旧地址。此产品不同于昨日已报的AWS API MCP Server；1.35.0的实际发布日期未由公告明确。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-11",
      "dateLabel": "11月11日 · 安全披露 · 近7日补充",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-11",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "AWS提权公告",
          "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-179-aws/",
          "icon": false
        },
        {
          "label": "AWS SSRF公告",
          "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-180-aws/",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ubuntu-hwe-kernel-security",
      "title": "Ubuntu 22.04 HWE 内核修补后需检查 GPU 模块",
      "titleId": "ubuntu-hwe-kernel-security-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "USN-9066-1将Ubuntu 22.04的linux-hwe-6.8更新至6.8.0-149.149~22.04.1，覆盖内存、网络与驱动安全修补，并处理特定AMD SEV-SNP和Arm内存保护问题。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "工作站和虚拟化开发环境应核对实际内核包，更新后重启。本次ABI变化要求重编、安装第三方内核模块，GPU驱动兼容性应纳入维护检查；并非新的上游Linux大版本。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-12",
      "dateLabel": "11月12日 · 安全更新",
